### Apprentice health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/health

### Model diagnostics
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/diag/models

### Style profiles
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/style/list

### Style compile
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/style/compile
content-type: application/json
x-auth-key: {{AUTH_KEY}}

{
  "style_profile_id": "epic_fantasy_cinematic",
  "positive_prompt": "armored rider, black mask, gloves, heavy boots, damaged robot escort",
  "scene_prompt": "outdoor battlefield, fire and ash, storm clouds",
  "negative_prompt": "blurry, deformed",
  "cdp": {
    "summary": "armored rider on horse",
    "observed_facts": ["armored rider", "horse", "black gloves", "heavy boots"],
    "confidence": 0.8
  },
  "acp": {
    "summary": "outdoor battlefield with fire and smoke",
    "observed_facts": ["fire", "smoke", "open field", "stormy sky"],
    "confidence": 0.78
  },
  "sip": {
    "summary": "cinematic fantasy style, low angle",
    "observed_facts": ["cinematic light", "low angle", "high contrast"],
    "confidence": 0.81
  }
}

### Generation schema
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/schema/generate

### Origin generate (SDXL txt2img)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/generate
content-type: application/json
x-auth-key: {{AUTH_KEY}}

{
  "origin": "sdxl",
  "prompt": "cinematic portrait of a cyberpunk detective, volumetric light, detailed textures",
  "negative_prompt": "blurry, low quality, distorted face",
  "width": 1024,
  "height": 1024,
  "num_steps": 20,
  "guidance": 7.5,
  "seed": 1234
}

### Origin generate (Dreamshaper img2img)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/origin/generate
content-type: application/json
x-auth-key: {{AUTH_KEY}}

{
  "origin": "dreamshaper",
  "prompt": "turn this into a stylized fantasy portrait with painterly detail",
  "negative_prompt": "artifacts, warped anatomy",
  "image_b64": "{{IMAGE_BASE64}}",
  "strength": 0.75,
  "guidance": 7.0,
  "width": 1024,
  "height": 1024,
  "num_steps": 20
}

### Fractal generate (alternating img2img)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/fractal
content-type: application/json
x-auth-key: {{AUTH_KEY}}

{
  "origin": "sdxl",
  "prompt": "keep face identity stable, increase cinematic atmosphere and contrast",
  "negative_prompt": "extra limbs, warped face, blur",
  "image_b64": "{{IMAGE_BASE64}}",
  "iterations": 3,
  "strength": 0.8,
  "guidance": 7.5,
  "width": 1024,
  "height": 1024,
  "num_steps": 20,
  "seed": 999
}

